+        },
+        "interpretation": (
+            "V28 tests one estimator change after the V27 TRAIN failure: the 24-D fixed atom-type representation is held fixed, but local type-KNN confirmation is replaced by a global equal-prior diagonal-Gaussian catastrophic-mode contrast. "
+            "V25 aggregate DRC remains the sole proposal control; support, scalar dominance, K=32/64, downside multiplier=1, zero boundary and extremal ranking are frozen. The global type view may only veto that same proposal under a TRAIN-frozen catastrophic threshold (-0.5) and 95% teacher-positive proposal coverage calibration; failed confirmation returns directly to the incumbent with no fallback. "
+            "Promotion requires the monotone subset invariant, non-harmful selected replacements, recovery, strictly incremental selected negative-tail behavior over V25 DRC, asymmetric preservation and endpoint non-inferiority independently on this untouched block."
+        ),
